## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not wire finalization/merge seams here (that is TP-203). Do not enable global-fix PRs or admin-bypass. Do not resolve threads during remediation (reply only).

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

